### Submit invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/delivery-by-amazon/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"IN","query":{"orderId":"ORDER-1","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-1"},"body":{}}

### Get invoice status
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/delivery-by-amazon/invoice/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"IN","query":{"orderId":"ORDER-1","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-1","marketplaceId":"A21TJRUUN4KGV","invoiceType":"TAX_INVOICE","programType":"DELIVERY_BY_AMAZON"}}
